---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Sourcedreviews handles your information."
>
  <article class="prose">
    <header>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="summary">Last updated: September 2026.</p>
    </header>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>Sourcedreviews collects the minimum information needed to operate the site:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Email messages you send us.</strong> When you write to <a href="mailto:contact@sourcedreviews.com">contact@sourcedreviews.com</a>, we receive and store whatever you include in your message.</li>
      <li><strong>Standard server logs.</strong> Our hosting provider records basic request metadata (IP address, user agent, page requested, response code). These logs are retained for a short operational period and not sold or shared.</li>
      <li><strong>Aggregate analytics.</strong> We may use a privacy-respecting analytics tool to count page visits. No personally identifying information is stored.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What we do not collect</h2>
    <p>We do not run third-party advertising networks. We do not use third-party tracking pixels. We do not collect names, addresses, phone numbers, or payment information.</p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>Sourcedreviews does not set any tracking cookies. We may set a small functional cookie if needed for site operation.</p>

    <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
    <p>Affiliate networks may set their own cookies when you click an affiliate link, in order to attribute a purchase. Those cookies are governed by the affiliate network's privacy policy, not this one.</p>

    <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
    <p>Sourcedreviews is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect information from children.</p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>If you have written to us and would like your message deleted, write to <a href="mailto:contact@sourcedreviews.com">contact@sourcedreviews.com</a> with "Deletion" in the subject line.</p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>We will update this policy if our practices change. The "Last updated" date at the top reflects the most recent revision.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>